<![CDATA[<p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">Thank you for your email. This email is converted to a Case {!Case.CaseNumber} and will be handled in the order it was received.&nbsp;You can expect a response within 48 hours.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">If you have an urgent matter or you would like to contact us by phone, please call us at 877-968-7474.&nbsp;Our hours of operation are from 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM CST, Monday through Friday.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">Thank you,&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-indent-1" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 3em; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: black;">Section 125, Health &amp; Welfare Services&nbsp;</span></p>]]></td>
